					"old": "Prepare to <span class=\"highlight\">deflect</span> the next incoming attack. On a successful deflection, briefly become <span class=\"highlight\">invulnerable</span> and target an enemy hero to dash towards them, <span class=\"highlight\">immobilizing</span> and <span class=\"highlight\">disarming</span> them, preventing them from <span class=\"highlight\">parrying</span>, and reducing their <span class=\"highlight\">Melee Resist</span>.<br><br><span class=\"diminish\">Press Ability 2 to select a target.<br>Does not trigger against trooper or neutral damage.</span>",
